{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"notes\": {\n    \"甲\": \"甲把疲惫却未中断的牵挂、过去真实存在的柔软与向往、不可挽回之事带来的持续阻力连成了一条清楚的情感发展线，并指出柔弱如今也能成为前进的动力；但它对压力如何逐轮累积、步伐为何从试探转向不可回避，以及停滞为何开始松动，主要给出概括性解释，身体反应与心理转折之间的局部因果桥还不够充分。\",\n    \"乙\": \"乙具体解释了期待放轻为何只能暂时减轻靠近的力度而不能消除在乎、反复发力为何会把未解除的压力带入下一轮，以及自我检查未能换来安全后身体如何把力量从压住冲动转向实际前行，并由此产生有限的解脱；但身体逐渐无力分开不同感受等细节属于有解释力的心理推断，并非听感记录能够独立证实的唯一机制。\"\n  },\n  \"verdict\": \"乙 版不差于 甲 版\",\n  \"why\": \"乙保留了甲关于柔软的牵挂推动前行、不可挽回的压力始终存在的核心解释，同时更清楚地补出了压力累积、身体先于念头行动以及应对方式失效后感受随之改变的因果链，因此在解释机制上没有实质退步。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c3933472-9898-4949-84fe-5ad561cac8ab", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T140759462872Z", "elapsed_seconds": 84.14, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:09:23.598062+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "0491244e6b00b5bcc553c7c1859a18cfdba2f0ce4fae78a743b3b169413a37c4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f